      "id": "concept-thesis-defense-offense-sword-pun",
      "kind": "concept",
      "promptEs": "defensa de tesis · ataque de tesis",
      "questionEn": "Why does the thesis presentation turn into a sword attack?",
      "answerEn": "The comic takes the defensive metaphor in “thesis defense” literally and answers it with a thesis offense.",
      "noteEn": "A thesis defense is normally an oral examination, not combat. Calling the sword charge an ataque de tesis creates the opposite of defensa de tesis and literalizes the English caption's defense/offense wordplay.",
